  "job_B8.1.4.5_20251003_114817": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00f0 wineardas & delfa\u00f0, & ge ne drinca\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6rof, for \u00f0am \u00f0e wurmas hine freta\u00f0. Ealle eowre elebeamas forwur\u00f0a\u00f0. Ge stryna\u00f0 suna & dohtra, & ne bruca\u00f0 heora, for \u00f0am \u00f0e hi man l\u00e6t to o\u00f0rum lande. Ragu & meos fornym\u00f0 ealle eowres landes w\u00e6stmas. Vtancymene eardia\u00f0 on eowrum lande & beo\u00f0 wyldran \u00f0onne ge & eow geny\u00f0eria\u00f0. Hi l\u00e6na\u00f0 eow & ge ne l\u00e6na\u00f0 him; hi beo\u00f0 on foreweard & ge on \u00e6fteweard. Ealle \u00f0as wyrignyssa cuma\u00f0 ofer eow & eow fordo\u00f0, for \u00f0am \u00f0e ge forhogedon Drihtnes beboda, & & tacnu & forebeacnu wur\u00f0a\u00f0 on eow & on eowrum ofspryngce. & ge \u00f0eowia\u00f0 eowrum feondum, & Drihten asent hungor on eow & \u00f0urst & n\u00e6cede & \u00e6lce w\u00e6dle; & he asent \u00f0eoda ofer eow of feorwegum, \u00f0\u00e6ra spr\u00e6ca ge ne cunnon. Ge beo\u00f0 swa lange inne besetene, o\u00f0 ge eta\u00f0 eowre agene suna & dohtra, buton ge healdon \u00f0isse \u00e6 Drihten geeacno\u00f0 eowre wito & eowres cynrynes wito; \u00f0a wyrstan untrumnyssa & \u00f0one m\u00e6stan ece & \u00f0\u00e6r to eacan ealle \u00f0a adla \u00f0e synt awritene on \u00f0isse bec, he sent ofer eow, \u00f0\u00e6t ge forwur\u00f0an. & eower wur\u00f0a\u00f0 feawa to lafe, \u00f0e \u00e6r w\u00e6ron swa fela swa heofones tungla, for \u00f0am \u00f0e ge ne & swa Dri",
